From 285a732cd98c8f09f6d0f37315540e243ff245ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 17:29:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Kernel session: NAP vector builtins, char-literal asm args,
 symbol chains, local-reloc conversion, -march=native

Re-land + extend the kernel-build gap fixes on top of d6c5d5f2:

1) Raw GCC vector builtins (BY VALUE, no _mm_ wrapper deref):
   - __builtin_ia32_shufps -> ShufPs128 via Vec128Value (imm8 passes through)
   - __builtin_shufflevector: 4-lane 32-bit gather (v1||v2 concat indexing,
     constant indices via eval_const_expr; negative = don't-care)
   - __builtin_convertvector(expr, TYPE): new Expr::ConvertVector AST node
     (parser intercepts the identifier; second arg is a TYPE like va_arg);
     v4si->v4sf = cvtdq2ps, v4sf->v4si = cvttps2dq; other combos panic loudly
   - 256-bit: maxps256/minps256 (VMAXPS/VMINPS), andps256 (pand256,
     bitwise-identical), cmpps256 (imm8), vextractf128_ps256 (by-value I128),
     vzeroupper. v8sf keeps pointer/sret convention.
   - call-argument spill: a nested by-value builtin result (packed I128) is
     spilled to a 16-byte slot and passed as pointer; without this the
     param-cast path fed the I128 to __floattisf and callees dereferenced
     garbage (SIGSEGV repro in builtin_vector_shuffle_convert.c 'nest').
   PROOF: runtime lane-exact vs GCC -O0/-O2 (movhl/shuf/nest/cvt/trunc/
   hmax/clamp8/hi128/ge), regression builtin_vector_shuffle_convert.c +
   builtin_avx256_raw.c.

2) GAS char literals in macro args/operands ('r', ' ', ','):
   split_macro_args (x86 parser), split_operands, split_on_commas_raw and
   split_field_on_whitespace (asm_preprocess) all treat the byte after a
   single quote as data. relocate_kernel_64.S print_reg emitted a reloc
   against the symbol-quote (ld: undefined reference). PROOF:
   asm-diff char_literal_macro_args.s byte-identical to GAS.

3) Symbol+constant chains in data exprs: the " - " SymbolDiff path folds
   the full LHS chain (sym+8 + 0 + 2 - .) via parse_symbol_expr_chain;
   kernel jump-label keys (JUMP_TABLE_ENTRY %c0-with-addend) previously
   produced relocs against the literal string name. PROOF: asm-diff
   symbol_addend_chain.s; reloc __tracepoint_read_msr + a == GAS.

4) Local-symbol relocations convert to section-symbol + offset like GAS
   (all local defined labels, not just .L). objtool accepts STT_SECTION/
   STT_FUNC only in .rela.discard.func_stack_frame_non_standard;
   optprobe_template_func stayed STT_NOTYPE and objtool rejected kprobes/
   opt.o. PROOF: stt2.s reloc '.text + 0' identical to GCC output.

5) -march=native: host CPUID probe via is_x86_feature_detected (x86-64
   hosts only; explicit error elsewhere). Kernel NAP nap_nn_native.o
   compiles with CC_FLAGS_FPU + -march=native.

Validation: cargo test 685 pass; regression 187 pass (2 new); correctness
50/50; intrinsics 3/3; linker 86/86; differential fuzz 300/300 (O0/O2,
seeds 0:150); asm-diff ALL RAW .text BYTES EXACT.
